size 100 10
start
keys go
frame a-frame
fg a-fg
cursor a-cursor
file todo.txt a-file
type New
keys <CR>
frame b-frame
fg b-fg
file todo.txt b-file
keys u
frame c-frame
file todo.txt c-file
keys <C-r>
file todo.txt b-file
